  "cooked": "<p>Analyzing logs by sampling from multiple nodes over a time-span of 3 days, it becomes visible that starting with 5 tokens (red step line) rather than 1 token (black step line) and keeping the same rate of 1 new token every 10 seconds would help to drastically reduce false-positives.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88_2_690x493.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kJBcNISX0uvszFR8fer4WLoHJxe\" width=\"690\" height=\"493\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88_2_690x493.jpeg, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88_2_1035x739.jpeg 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/91531183f6cf5423eb5263144917de4ceeb14a88.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C0B0C9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1172\u00d7838 140 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
